{"team":"MIN","col":"#A06BE8","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":58.4,"adot":8.2,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Balanced Attack</h2><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Justin Jefferson</strong> \u2014 <strong>30% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>This is an aggressive, pass-leaning attack: <strong>+1%</strong> pass rate over expected, top of the league's range, and no interest in sitting on a lead (42% pass when ahead).</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (54% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>This is a deliberate, low-volume offense \u2014 just <strong>58 plays a game</strong> (league ~61), which quietly caps the ceiling on everybody's targets and carries.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>pass-first</strong> (61% pass), which puts scoring equity on <strong>Justin Jefferson</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p><strong>Soft against opposing WR2s</strong> \u2014 53 rec yds/game (vs ~36). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They surrender <strong>109 rushing</strong> and <strong>220 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>They lock down backs out of the backfield \u2014 just 12 rec yds/game (vs ~18); fade receiving props there.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 41% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs).</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Kyler Murray","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Comp":8.12,"Att":12.01,"Pass Yds":83.18,"Pass TD":0.49,"INT":0.6,"Rush Yds":19.29}},{"name":"J.J. McCarthy","slot":"QB2","starter":false,"td":21,"props":{"Comp":5.69,"Att":9.61,"Pass Yds":65.84,"Pass TD":0.45,"INT":0.98,"Rush Yds":11.63}}],"RB":[{"name":"Aaron Jones","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":33,"props":{"Rush Att":14.91,"Rush Yds":69.96,"Tgt":3.52,"Rec":2.77,"Rec Yds":20.86}},{"name":"Jordan Mason","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":23,"props":{"Rush Att":7.33,"Rush Yds":36.83,"Tgt":1.48,"Rec":1.2,"Rec Yds":8.27}},{"name":"Demond Claiborne","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Rush Att":2.43,"Rush Yds":10.6,"Tgt":0.82,"Rec":0.56,"Rec Yds":4.0}}],"WR":[{"name":"Justin Jefferson","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":26,"props":{"Tgt":7.3,"Rec":4.86,"Rec Yds":69.69,"Rec TD":0.31}},{"name":"Jordan Addison","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":21,"props":{"Tgt":4.02,"Rec":2.47,"Rec Yds":33.2,"Rec TD":0.24}},{"name":"Jauan Jennings","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":23,"props":{"Tgt":5.04,"Rec":3.24,"Rec Yds":40.41,"Rec TD":0.26}},{"name":"Tai Felton","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":7,"props":{"Tgt":1.89,"Rec":1.07,"Rec Yds":12.26,"Rec TD":0.07}}],"TE":[{"name":"T.J. Hockenson","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":16,"props":{"Tgt":4.22,"Rec":3.11,"Rec Yds":31.43,"Rec TD":0.18}},{"name":"Josh Oliver","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":18,"props":{"Tgt":3.09,"Rec":1.93,"Rec Yds":19.44,"Rec TD":0.21}},{"name":"Ben Yurosek","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Tgt":2.28,"Rec":1.4,"Rec Yds":13.74,"Rec TD":0.12}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"vs","opp":"GB","opp_col":"#FFD84D","gid":"2026_01_GB_MIN","spread":"+1.5","proj":"22\u201323","win":false},{"week":2,"ha":"@","opp":"CHI","opp_col":"#F1873B","gid":"2026_02_MI